{"t":"The Fire-Feathered Serpent World Change","s":"the-fire-feathered-serpent-world-change-2fadf","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Seacrest Grounds World Change</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(100 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Change</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Deep under the Sea, a Fire Feathered Serpent sleeps, but its Guardian needs help protecting their realm.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Grounds\">Seacrest Grounds</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer\">Devourer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Beast\">Blood Beast</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rot%20Elemental\">Rot Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Glob%20of%20Glooth\">Glooth Glob</a>, all types of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quaras</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Abyssal%20Calamary\">Abyssal Calamary</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Crab\">Blood Crab</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shark\">Shark</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Young%20Sea%20Serpent\">Young Sea Serpent</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpent</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpent</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Chance to complete the <a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a> and get the achievements <a href=\"#/wiki/Mind%20the%20Step%21\">Mind the Step!</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake%20Charmer\">Snake Charmer</a>, ability to fight <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Renegade Quaras</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p>This world change is related to the <a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">Twenty Miles Beneath the Sea Quest</a>. One distinctive characteristic of it is that its change of states occur immediately after being triggered, and not after the next <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a> as with most <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Changes</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Grounds\">Seacrest Grounds</a> can have two states, which are a reflection of the situation of the <i>Fire-Feathered Serpent</i>. Usually, the serpent is asleep and you will find regular <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quaras</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpents</a> in the Seacrest Grounds. During this stage, Guide NPCs will inform the following state:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: Sea Serpent<br/>\nGuide NPC: The Fire-Feathered Serpent is fast asleep.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p>Once <b>1000</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpents</a> are killed across the <a href=\"#/wiki/Game%20Worlds\">World</a>, the World Change will not be triggered yet, but there will be a server-broadcast that the Serpent is being awakened:\n</p><p><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Sleeping beneath the Oramond sea, the Fire-Feathered Serpent twitches and dreams of calling its children back.</span>\n</p><p>If the Quara raid on Western Oramond is currently running, it will immediately stop and all Quaras will disappear from the surface. The Guide NPCs will also give a different answer:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: Sea Serpent<br/>\nGuide NPC: The Fire-Feathered Serpent dreams and the earth is bleeding lava.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p>As soon as an additional <b>1000</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpents</a> (i.e. a total of <b>2000</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpents</a>) are killed, the World Change will be activated, and the regular Quaras, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpents</a> will be replaced by <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Renegade Quaras</a>. The following message will be broadcast to all players:\n</p><p><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent has awoken! Renegade Quara attack the sunken lands of Oramond!</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: Sea Serpent<br/>\nGuide NPC: The Fire-Feathered Serpent is awake. Renegade Quara control the sunken regions of Oramond.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p>When this happens, the <a href=\"#/quest/twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest\">The Fire-Feathered Sea Serpent mission</a> of the quest will become available. If you want to complete this mission or fight the Renegade Quara, you should hurry to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Grounds\">Seacrest Grounds</a> as it usually doesn't last very long.\n</p><p>Once the mission is done and <b>2000</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Renegade Quaras</a> are killed, the Fire-Feathered Serpent will go back to sleep, and the world change will return to its default stage.\n</p><p><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The Fire-Feathered Serpent goes back to sleep, beseeched by the blood of the Renegade Quara.</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["twenty-miles-beneath-the-sea-quest"]}